      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "1",
      "description": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The Sister projects her wrath and rage into the minds of any number of creatures of her choice within 30 feet. Targeted creatures must attempt a @Check[will|dc:32] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is Off-Guard for 1 round as they become distracted by the unexpected fit of rage.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is Confused for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is confused for as long as they remain within 30 feet of the Sister, or until they succeed at the @Check[flat|dc:11] to recover.</p>",
